Below is a partial (more info below) list of build error/warning
regressions/improvements in v2.6.36-rc4 compared to v2.6.35.

When comparing v2.6.36-rc4 to v2.6.36-rc3, the summaries are:
 - build errors: +6/-55
 - build warnings: +58/-132
But please take into account this is a partial list, as only 55 out of the 108
configs have build logs for v2.6.36-rc4. Still, it's worthwhile to look at the
regressions.

In addition, I put the verbose summary at
http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/people/geert/linux-log/v2.6.36-rc3.summary.gz
so you can easily find out for which configs and architectures the
errors/warnings you're interested in are happening.

Happy fixing! ;-)

Thanks to the linux-next team for providing the build service.


